            "value": "Inulin powder for high dispersibility, described as instant. [1]"
          },
          {
            "index": 1,
            "label": "Application check",
            "value": "Ask about powder incorporation in your mixing sequence; do not equate “instant” with a clear finished drink."
          },
          {
            "index": 2,
            "label": "Manufacturer's distinction",
            "value": "Highly soluble inulin powder. [1]"
          },
          {
            "index": 3,
            "label": "Application check",
            "value": "Use a solubility-led brief, with the actual concentration, preparation temperature and storage state specified."
          },
          {
            "index": 4,
            "label": "Manufacturer's distinction",
            "value": "Both described as high-performance long-chain inulin for fat replacement, but for low and high processing temperatures respectively. [1]"
          },
          {
            "index": 5,
            "label": "Application check",
            "value": "Disclose the thermal route before accepting an apparently similar long-chain grade."
          },
          {
            "index": 6,
            "label": "Manufacturer's distinction",
            "value": "Longer-chain, texturizing chicory fibre, with fat-mimetic positioning in higher-moisture systems. [7]"
          },
          {
            "index": 7,
            "label": "Application check",
            "value": "Ask for texture development in the actual dessert or spread, not merely a clear beaker test."
          },
          {
            "index": 8,
            "label": "Manufacturer's distinction",
            "value": "Liquid oligofructose with binding and low-moisture-system positioning. [7]"
          },
          {
            "index": 9,
            "label": "Application check",
            "value": "Include supplied water and solids in the formulation comparison; a syrup is not a powder replacement by weight alone."
          }
